                      ),
                    ),
                  ),
                ),
                Expanded(
                  child: GetX<SearchResultScreenController>(
                    builder: (controller) => AnimatedScreenTransition(
                      enabled: Get.find<SettingsScreenController>()
                          .isTransitionAnimationDisabled
